ers from The Wizard  of Oz and the dirndl dress and the  guitar that Julie Julie Andrews wore and  played in the in The Sound of Music to  name just a few  while today the value of these pieces is  inestimable the worth they're worth in  the world was not always credited and  Debbie struggled and she sacrificed for  decades acquiring these items  undertaking the cost by herself  of storing and maintaining them this has  been a crusade for Debbie and today as  the as the Academy embarks on securing a  home a repository for the record of our  film heritage Debbie Reynolds  preservation fight must be recognized  and rewarded  it's because of her early and continuing  efforts that the Academy Museum will  house the beautiful actual tangible  evidence of the imagination of our most  gifted artists the work of many many  thousands of hands that make up the  history of design will be seen and  appreciated for all time for her  demonstration of devotion to the  entertainment industry that she has  loved and she has served all her life  and for her tireless efforts on behalf  of the faily UNS the mental health  center of Cedar sinai and UCLA's  operation mend as a mother as a  grandmother and as a preserver of  Hollywood's treasures I am truly proud  and deeply honored to present the  remarkable inimitable beautiful miss  Burbank Debbie Reynolds with the Jean  Hersholt Humanitarian Award  and so sorry that I'm sick but I have  thrilled beyond words shocked and you  couldn't be more amazed that a little  girl from Burbank even came here this  sort of accolade anything I've ever done  is to their recognition for the audience  to always love the work and not just the  work that they do this was for mental  health you have to love love the cause I  have tried thank you feel wonderful news  god bless you I thank you very much  and as Debbie can't be with us tonight  her granddaughter Billie lourd is here  to accept this honor on her behalf  Billie  signing hi I'm Debbie's granddaughter  Billie I'm here to accept I'm here to  accept the award on her behalf cuz as  you know she sadly can't be here it  honestly feels super weird to be up here  without her cuz she's always been the  leader of our family whether it be it  award shows like this or at home I've  truly never seen him it I've never seen  her miss a show in her life but  unfortunately our leader needed a little  backup tonight so I'm here to thank the  Academy and all of you in this room for  this truly incredible honor I can't tell  you how excited she is about it I'll be  taking it home to her right now so we  can cuddle with it and she can put it in  the place she's always secretly saved  for it  I think it's next to the ruby slippers  we'll see thank you so much
 

